{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17220","headline":"崔四郎协律以诗见寄兼惠蜀琴因以酬赠 · 权德舆","name":"崔四郎协律以诗见寄兼惠蜀琴因以酬赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"临风结烦想，客至传好音。\n白雪缄郢曲，朱弦亘蜀琴。\n泠泠响幽韵，欵欵寄遐心。\n岁晚何以报，与君期断金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17220.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17220","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}